,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.339688604,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__uncle__1__l1 orpheus__uncle__1 laugh | For dumpling research!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.340580273,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__uncle__1__l2 orpheus__uncle__1 tiny | There was soup inside.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.342760542,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__uncle__1__l3 orpheus__uncle__1 dreamy | I smell... destiny. And a little bit of ginger.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.344623766,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__uncle__1__l4 orpheus__uncle__1 tender | Little one, a good meal is a good friend. Come, sit.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.349071808,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__narrator__1__l1 orpheus__narrator__1 solemn | Legend says, in a small shop, one very large bun.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.350556823,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__narrator__1__l2 orpheus__narrator__1 solemn | Many people believe it was the best bun in all the land.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.353544484,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__narrator__1__l3 orpheus__narrator__1 tender | And so the hungry traveler walked on, toward the next town.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.354393878,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__narrator__1__l4 orpheus__narrator__1 excited | Behold! The Great Bun of Nanxiang!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.355245788,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__grandma__1__l1 orpheus__grandma__1 neutral | Everybody asks. We never pour it in. First we turn it into jelly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.35850326,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__grandma__1__l2 orpheus__grandma__1 laugh | Hah! Too hot? I did tell you, my dear.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.359331155,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__grandma__1__l3 orpheus__grandma__1 tender | Your father sat right there. He was very patient.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.360177992,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__grandma__1__l4 orpheus__grandma__1 neutral | Eight folds, no more, no less. Watch my fingers.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.363504229,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__host__1__l1 orpheus__host__1 host | Welcome back to the Silk Road. Today, one dumpling, one big question.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.364346223,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__host__1__l2 orpheus__host__1 excited | Wait for it... here comes the steam!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.365190801,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__host__1__l3 orpheus__host__1 tender | Dad was right. The best part is always the part you wait for.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":895.36849203,"data":"18:52:06   orpheus__host__1__l4 orpheus__host__1 host | Let's go find out!\n"}
